# Analytics (F-03) — Plausible, cookieless and GDPR-friendly (no consent
# banner needed). Leave unset and the app runs with analytics as a permanent
# no-op — safe for local dev, forks, and any build without a Plausible
# account. Set this to your real site domain (as registered in Plausible)
# only in the production deploy's environment, not in a committed .env file.
VITE_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=
